invariant: INV-36
file: chapulin.zig
catches: test/zig-build-check.sh
reason: chapulin.Client's takes_tickets defaults to false. Every Zig
  caller that does not name the field, colibri among them, then keeps no
  ticket and takeTicket returns null, with no error. Both loops take the
  ticket of a client with the default values, and object.

--- old
    takes_tickets: bool = true,
--- new
    takes_tickets: bool = false,
